From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Thomas Karpiniec <tom.karpiniec@outlook.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 13:20:00 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] wifi: iwlwifi: mld: update mac80211 on NAN cluster join

Report cluster changes through mac80211 so its NAN receive filter sees the
current cluster ID. Calling cfg80211 directly leaves that ID all zeroes,
causing incoming discovery and data frames to be rejected by the NAN vif.

Backport the notification path from the pinned Intel backport driver.

Upstream-Status: Backport [https://kernel.googlesource.com/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/iwlwifi/backport-iwlwifi/+/070e486a6d462c79bf6356832af28e45c1b94519/drivers/net/wireless/intel/iwlwifi/mld/nan.c]
Signed-off-by: Thomas Karpiniec <tom.karpiniec@outlook.com>
---
--- a/drivers/net/wireless/intel/iwlwifi/mld/nan.c
+++ b/drivers/net/wireless/intel/iwlwifi/mld/nan.c
@@ -339,3 +339,4 @@

-	cfg80211_nan_cluster_joined(wdev, cluster_id, new_cluster, GFP_KERNEL);
+	ieee80211_nan_cluster_joined(mld->nan_device_vif, cluster_id,
+				     new_cluster, GFP_KERNEL);
 }
--
